<mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c342" value="User and garment ids are Long or String and point to other services: there are no references to their classes. Relations between entities are logical, by id (no foreign keys across services)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;fillColor=#E8DDCA;strokeColor=#8E8CA0;fontColor=#262626;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Poppins;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DPoppins;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2534" width="560" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c343" value="Dashed line with open arrow: dependency or reference by id. Filled diamond: composition. Hollow triangle: inheritance. Orange: interface · yellow: value object / record · pink: enum · lilac: class." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;fillColor=#BAB9C9;strokeColor=#8E8CA0;fontColor=#262626;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Poppins;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DPoppins;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="2534" width="620" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c344" value="The use-case implementations, DTOs, adapters and controllers are shown in the component diagram. Every domain exception carries a stable CodigoError that GlobalExceptionHandler turns into the code field of the ProblemDetail response." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;fillColor=#E8DDCA;strokeColor=#8E8CA0;fontColor=#262626;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Poppins;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DPoppins;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="2534" width="700" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>